tions. Many students aren’t even sure where to start. Whether you’re set on a career path or need help figuring things out - Seton Hill’s award-winning Career and Professional Development Center is here for you. From your first class to your first job after graduation - and beyond. Because, like the benefits of your Seton Hill education, the services of the Career and Professional Development Center will be available to you for life. We're Here to Help! Renee Starek Executive Director, Career and Professional Development Center George Carter Assistant Director Experiential Learning and Employer Relations Heidi Schuman Assistant Director Career & Professional Development Center In This Section Success After Seton Hill Seton Hill Career Team Success Stories Career & Professional Development Center Seton Hill University 1 Seton Hill Drive, Greensburg, PA 15601 (800) 826-6234 MySHU Bookstore Library & Learning Center Offices Campus Safety Contact Us Employment Consumer Information Privacy Policy Give to Seton Hill Â© 2026 Seton Hill University. All rights reserved."
